{start_of_verse label="Verse 1"}
I'm a [E]poor boy, a long way from home,
I'm a [A]poor boy, a long way from [E]home,
[B7]Out in this [A]wide world a[E]lone. [B7]
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse label="Verse 2"}
[E]Rather drink muddy water, sleep in a hollow log,
[A]Rather drink muddy water, sleep in a hollow [E]log,
[B7]Than stay here and be [A]treated like a [E]dog. [B7]
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse label="Verse 3"}
